{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. First, scan the area. Then, if an object is near, grab it and move to destination. Otherwise, approach object, grab, check properties, and perform a specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />",
